From 1a01c1e90c8d9207d69805f7abf2210281de32b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 05:26:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Unify job listing format: About the Role / Responsibilities /
 Qualifications

Adds the full Lead Design Verification Engineer job description
(renamed from "Design Verification Engineer" to match the title
given) with its own Preferred Experience section.

Restructured Custom Layout Engineer and Physical Design Engineer into
the same section layout for consistency. Their "About the Role" intro
and "Responsibilities" lists are written by me, derived from their
existing Requirements bullets (which become part of Qualifications
alongside the former Soft Skills) -- worth a read-through since that
content wasn't provided directly, unlike the Design Verification JD
which is used verbatim. Left them without a Preferred Experience
section since no extra material was given for those two roles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SjcntVjf5Nr2bdomgFdfPu
